WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:07.358
<v Maya>Hi Ms. Nova! I just got my robot arms. How do I start?

2
00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:14.916
<v Ms. Nova>Hi Maya! Welcome to GRIP. Your kit has two arms. The leader is the one you move with your hand, and the follower copies you.

3
00:00:15.377 --> 00:00:17.787
<v Maya>Can I try it without plugging anything in?

4
00:00:18.245 --> 00:00:22.810
<v Ms. Nova>Yes! Click Use a pretend arm on the leader card, and then on the follower card.

5
00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:25.233
<v Maya>Cool, both arms are connected!

6
00:00:25.706 --> 00:00:32.746
<v Ms. Nova>With real arms, you click Connect both arms and pick the USB ports instead. Now turn on the follower's motors.

7
00:00:33.221 --> 00:00:35.205
<v Maya>What's the big red button at the top?

8
00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:42.791
<v Ms. Nova>That's STOP. If anything looks wrong, press STOP, or the Escape key. Robot rule number one: hands clear, then press go!

9
00:00:43.259 --> 00:00:45.072
<v Maya>Got it! Hands clear, then go.
